- PAUSE
- RESUME
- RESET_COUNTER

Security requirements:

- Require authenticated users.
- Follow backend RBAC.
- Require factory LAN access.
- Require a reason with minimum five characters.
- Display target device and machine.
- Display a confirmation dialog.
- Show transaction ID and execution result.

Respect these permission restrictions:

| Command | Allowed roles |
|---|---|
| PAUSE | OPERATOR, SUPERVISOR, ADMIN |
| RESUME | OPERATOR, SUPERVISOR, ADMIN |
| RESET_COUNTER | SUPERVISOR, ADMIN |

Never create an unrestricted generic MQTT command interface.

The frontend must not suggest that publishing a command means the physical machine has successfully executed it.

